1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,880
Roxgold SiteLife.
Completing your Camp Induction.

2
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:09,500
When you arrive, the camp rules
are often passed on by word of mouth.

3
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:16,900
Opening hours, safety, emergency contacts: they are hard to remember,
and nothing proves they were understood.

4
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:24,790
With Roxgold SiteLife, every new arrival follows
the Camp Induction: a guided journey in six steps.

5
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:27,750
It ends with a signature
and a certificate.

6
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:34,160
As soon as you are housed at the camp,
the app opens the Camp Induction directly.

7
00:00:34,210 --> 00:00:37,680
Until it is completed,
the other pages remain locked.

8
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:43,270
The welcome screen presents your journey,
which takes about fifteen minutes.

9
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:44,740
Tap Start the induction.

10
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:50,260
Step 2: the camp facilities.
Tap an area to discover it.

11
00:00:53,790 --> 00:00:59,380
Each card gives the essentials:
opening hours, rules of use, instructions.

12
00:01:01,790 --> 00:01:05,740
After four areas visited,
the Continue button becomes active.

13
00:01:08,790 --> 00:01:14,510
Step 3: the camp rules. They are ranked:
critical, important, standard.

14
00:01:16,790 --> 00:01:18,440
Tap each rule to read it.

15
00:01:23,790 --> 00:01:27,030
All the rules have been read:
move on to the validation quiz.

16
00:01:29,790 --> 00:01:34,590
Step 4: the quiz.
Ten questions, drawn at random.

17
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:37,520
Every answer must be correct.

18
00:01:38,790 --> 00:01:42,190
Choose one answer per question,
then submit the quiz.

19
00:01:45,790 --> 00:01:46,520
Quiz passed.

20
00:01:46,570 --> 00:01:52,140
If you make a mistake, you go back to the rules,
then a new set of questions is offered.

21
00:01:53,790 --> 00:02:00,050
Step 5: power-hungry appliances. Any appliance
over 100 watts must be declared.

22
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:03,770
If you have none, choose
“I have no appliance”.

23
00:02:04,820 --> 00:02:10,990
To declare an appliance: choose the type,
enter the power and the room, then Declare.

24
00:02:12,820 --> 00:02:16,610
The appliance shows as declared.
Tap Continue.

25
00:02:18,820 --> 00:02:23,470
Step 6: the commitment.
The summary confirms each step.

26
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:30,300
Sign with your finger,
then tap Finalise my induction.

27
00:02:34,820 --> 00:02:38,790
Your induction certificate appears.
The rest of the app is unlocked.

28
00:02:42,820 --> 00:02:48,050
The rules are known, the quiz proves
they are understood, the signature commits.

29
00:02:48,100 --> 00:02:52,670
The administration sees who has finished,
from the induction register.

30
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:56,570
Roxgold SiteLife.
Welcome to the camp.
